,title,link,text,language,family
0,Koi language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Koi_language,"Koyee (कोयी) is a Sino-Tibetan language belonging to the Kiranti languages spoken in the Khotang district of Nepal. Like other Kiranti languages, it displays a fairly complex system of person-marking and stem alternations.",Koyee,Sino-Tibetan
